              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wejima wawu hiyakumuletelapa nyilambu yayuma yasiliva, niyumayawuru, niyuma yakuvwala, niyitwa yanjita, ninyiseki, nituwalu, niyingonŋavalu, yahamwaka hamwaka.",
          "type": "text",
