          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Solomoni wapompesheli nimakálu niakwatuwalu. Wadiŋi namakálu ikombakaji namakulakaji awana, akwatuwalu makombakaji ikumi nayedi, wayishilashili munyikala yakusweka makálu, amakwawu adiŋi namwanta muYerusalema. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwanta wavulishili siliva muYerusalema neyi malola, ninyisida wayivulishili kuvula kudi neyi nyishikima yekala munkulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tuwalu twadiŋi naSolomoni atufumishilaŋa muEjipitu; antu amwanta akwakulanda atutambwilaŋa yendu nayendu, chendu nawuseya wachu, chendu nawuseya wachu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ikalu dafuminaŋa muEjipitu dafwikilaŋa jishekeli jasiliva makulakaji atanu nadimu, kawalu kafwikilaŋa nkulakajina makumi atanu; niafuminaŋa kudi anyanta awaHiti, nikudi anyanta amuSiriya, ejima chochu nawa, ayiletelaŋa kudi antu awu.",
          "type": "text",
